// Axiom AgentBudget — initial Silverscript design skeleton.
//
// This file is intentionally a design-level contract until the exact
// Silverscript/Toccata project conventions used by the target deployment
// are pinned to a tested compiler version.
//
// Intended invariants:
// 1. An agent may spend no more than the configured per-spend limit.
// 2. Total spend cannot exceed the remaining budget.
// 3. Only an authorized asset/recipient can be used.
// 4. State transitions are explicit and auditable.
// 5. A rejected Axiom decision must never produce an executable transition.
//
// Do NOT deploy this skeleton with real funds.
// The next implementation step is to compile and test it against the
// current official Silverscript toolchain.
